#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L97
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:97
msgid ""
"Universal verifier applications that support different credential standards "
"are complicated by wide variability in format of the credential payloads, "
"signatures, key formats, and key distribution methods. Public keys formats "
"include x509 certificates, JSON Web Key Sets (JWKS), and DID documents. "
"Signing key distribution methods include API gateways, hosted by issuer at a"
" pre-defined URL, embedded in certificates, and by block-chain based "
"resolution. Establishing root of trust by trust anchor or distributing trust"
" list has been accomplished by API gateway, hosted URL, private "
"dissemination and other bilateral sharing agreements."
msgstr ""
"支持不同凭证标准的通用验证方应用程序，因凭证有效载荷、签名、密钥格式和密钥分发方法的格式差异很大而变得复杂。公钥格式包括x509证书、JSON "
"Web密钥集（JWKS）和DID文档。签名密钥的分发方法包括API网关、由签发方在预定义URL上托管、嵌入证书中，以及基于区块链的解析。通过信任锚建立信任根或分发信任列表，已通过API网关、托管URL、私下分发以及其他双边共享协议等方式实现。"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L148
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:148
msgid "Verifiable Digital Health Certificate"
msgstr "可验证数字健康证书"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L149
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:149
msgid ""
"Verifiable Digital Health Certificate: A digital representation of a data "
"set comprising a certificate or document, designed for a set of specific "
"clinical or public health use cases which is defined using open, "
"interoperable digital health standards; that contains within, or is "
"associated to, a digital signature which can be verified by the public key "
"of a public-private encryption key pair, and which is issued by a GDHCN "
"Participant."
msgstr ""
"可验证数字健康证书：一种数据集的数字表示形式，由证书或文档构成，针对一组特定的临床或公共卫生用例而设计，采用开放、可互操作的数字卫生保健标准定义；其内含或关联一个数字签名，该数字签名可通过公钥-"
"私钥加密密钥对中的公钥进行验证，并由GDHCN参与者签发。"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L99
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:99
msgid ""
"While some variability is expected in an approach that preserves "
"sovereignty, there are opportunities for alignment in key format and "
"distribution for the sake of fostering interoperability. With that goal, we "
"provide a unifying trust list format to assemble and share public key "
"infrastructure for all credential specifications used by existing trust "
"networks. Importantly, this format does not enforce a particular policy "
"framework for participants of the trust network."
msgstr ""
"虽然在维护主权的方法中预计会存在一定差异，但为促进互操作性，在密钥格式和分发方面存在协调一致的机会。为此，我们提供了一种统一的信任列表格式，用于汇集和共享现有信任网络所使用的所有凭证规范的公钥基础设施。重要的是，这种格式并不强制信任网络参与者采用特定的政策框架。"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md#L276
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_certificate_governance.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_certificate_governance.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md:276
msgid ""
"[1] eHealth Network. Interoperability of health certificates – Trust "
"Framework. Version 1.0. 12 March 2021. Last accessed 27 April 2021. [2] "
"eHealth Network. Technical Specifications for Digital COVID Certificates "
"Volume 1. Version V1.0.5. Last accessed 27 April 2021. [3] ETSI EN 319 "
"102-1: Electronic Signatures and Infrastructures (ESI); Procedures for "
"Creation and Validation of AdES Digital Signatures; Part 1: Creation and "
"Validation. Version 1.1.1. 2016. Last accessed 23 April 2021."
msgstr ""
"[1] eHealth Network. Interoperability of health certificates – Trust "
"Framework. Version 1.0. 2021年3月12日。最后访问日期：2021年4月27日。 [2] eHealth Network. "
"Technical Specifications for Digital COVID Certificates Volume 1. Version "
"V1.0.5. 最后访问日期：2021年4月27日。 [3] ETSI EN 319 102-1: Electronic Signatures and "
"Infrastructures (ESI); Procedures for Creation and Validation of AdES "
"Digital Signatures; Part 1: Creation and Validation. Version 1.1.1. "
"2016年。最后访问日期：2021年4月23日。"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md#L145
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_certificate_governance.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_certificate_governance.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md:145
msgid ""
"A SCA SHOULD NOT use the Online Certificate Status Protocol (OCSP) for their"
" DSCs, due to privacy concerns. GDHCN Participant Verifiers SHOULD NOT use "
"OCSP for verification of the DSCs and SHOULD use CRLs.  It is RECOMMENDED "
"that the GDHCN Participants' Backend performs necessary validation of DSC "
"certificates downloaded from the Trust Network Gateway and only forward a "
"set of trusted and validated DSC to GDHCN Participant Verifiers. GDHCN "
"Participant Verifiers SHOULD NOT perform any revocation checking on DSC in "
"their verification process. One reason for this is to protect the privacy of"
" the holders of Verifiable Digital Health Certificates by avoiding any "
"chance that the use of any particular DSC can be monitored by its associated"
" OCSP responder."
msgstr ""
"出于隐私方面的考虑，SCA不宜对其DSC使用在线证书状态协议（OCSP）。GDHCN参与者验证方不宜使用OCSP验证DSC，而宜使用CRL。推荐由GDHCN参与者后端对从信任网络网关下载的DSC证书进行必要的验证，并仅将一组可信且经过验证的DSC转发给GDHCN参与者验证方。GDHCN参与者验证方在其验证过程中不宜对DSC执行任何撤销检查。原因之一是保护可验证数字健康证书持有人的隐私，避免任何特定DSC的使用情况被其关联的OCSP响应方监测的可能性。"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md#L109
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_certificate_governance.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_certificate_governance.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md:109
msgid ""
"adds the TNPSCA certificate(s) to the trust list signed with the private key"
" that corresponds to the TNGTA public key"
msgstr "将TNPSCA证书添加到使用与TNGTA公钥相对应的私钥签名的信任列表中"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md#L110
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_certificate_governance.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_certificate_governance.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md:110
msgid "adds the TNPTLS certificate to the whitelist of the TNG TLS endpoint"
