msgid ""
"Digital certificates contain a validity period that enforces certificate "
"renewal. Renewal is necessary to use fresh cryptographic keys and to adapt "
"the key sizes when improvements in computation or new attacks threaten the "
"security of the cryptographic algorithm that is used.  The shell model "
"applies (see Section \"Signing Certificate Authorities and Validation "
"Model\"). The following validity periods are recommended based on the "
"assumption of the one-year maximum validity for Verifiable Digital Health "
"Certificates :"
msgstr ""
"数字证书包含有效期，以强制进行证书续期。续期是必要的，以便使用新的加密密钥，并在计算能力提升或新的攻击威胁到所用加密算法的安全时调整密钥长度。适用壳模型（见“签名证书颁发机构和验证模型”一节）。基于可验证数字健康证书最长有效期为一年的假设，建议采用以下有效期："

