#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md:125
msgid ""
"The secretariat must handle the following tasks to establish the on-boarding"
" process:"
msgstr "秘书处必须处理以下任务，以建立加入程序："

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md#L70
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md:70
msgid ""
"The Trust Network Gateway API can be used for interaction keeping the full "
"functionality of the EU DCC Gateway. In addition, various HL7 FHIR services "
"are being added."
msgstr "信任网络网关API可用于交互，并保留EU DCC Gateway的全部功能。此外，正在增加各种HL7 FHIR服务。"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md#L45
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md:45
msgid ""
"To establish a connection with the Trust Network Gateway (TNG) and become a "
"participant of the GDHCN, the participant is required to prepare their own "
"key materials for us to onboard onto the gateway. This process necessitates "
"technical expertise for the preparation of X.509 certificates, which are to "
"be stored in a GitHub repository owned by the participant for submission."
msgstr ""
"为与信任网络网关（TNG）建立连接并成为GDHCN的参与者，参与者须准备自己的密钥资料，供我们登记到网关上。这一过程需要具备准备X.509证书的技术专长，这些证书将存储在参与者拥有的GitHub存储库中以供提交。"

