msgid ""
"Git is cryptographically secure, but it’s not foolproof. If you’re taking "
"work from others on the internet and want to verify that commits are "
"actually from a trusted source, Git has a few ways to sign and verify work "
"using GPG."
msgstr ""
"Git在密码学上是安全的，但并非万无一失。如果您从互联网上获取他人的工作成果，并希望验证提交确实来自可信来源，Git提供了几种使用GPG对工作进行签名和验证的方法。"

