"reject when merging a commit that does not carry a trusted GPG signature "
"with the --verify-signatures command."
msgstr ""
"在Git 1.8.3及更高版本中，可通过--verify-signatures命令让git merge和git "
"pull在合并不带可信GPG签名的提交时进行检查并予以拒绝。"

