msgid ""
"In more recent versions of Git (v1.7.9 and above), you can now also sign "
"individual commits. If you’re interested in signing commits directly instead"
" of just the tags, all you need to do is add a -S to your git commit "
"command."
msgstr ""
"在较新版本的Git（v1.7.9及以上）中，现在还可以对单个提交进行签名。如果希望直接对提交而不仅是对标签进行签名，只需在git "
"commit命令中添加-S。"

