msgid ""
"When inviting both tng-bot and tng-bot-dev, select the role as \"Write\" "
"Click Add Selection to complete the invitation."
msgstr "邀请tng-bot和tng-bot-dev时，均选择“Write”角色，然后点击Add Selection完成邀请。"

