msgid ""
"After verification of the provisioned material, the content will be taken "
"over for the participant"
msgstr "对所提供的材料进行验证后，将为参与者纳入相关内容"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L63
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
