msgid ""
"Business rules for health credentials are the instructions, guidelines, and "
"regulations that express health policies such as \"this course of vaccines "
"meets jurisdiction entry requirements\" or \"this patient should complete "
"their immunization schedule\". These policies can support a range of "
"scenarios such as evaluating proof of vaccination or providing continuity of"
" care."
msgstr ""
"健康凭证的业务规则是表达卫生政策的指令、准则和规章，例如“该疫苗接种程序符合管辖区入境要求”或“该患者宜完成其免疫接种程序”。这些政策可支持一系列场景，例如评估疫苗接种证明或提供医疗连续性。"

