msgstr "安全和合规"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/faq.md#L22
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/faq.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/faq.html
#: input/pagecontent/faq.md:22
msgid "Technical Requirements and Infrastructure"
msgstr "技术要求和基础设施"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/faq.md#L53
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/faq.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/faq.html
#: input/pagecontent/faq.md:53
msgid ""
"The focus is on addressing security incidents, with no changes to the "
