#: input/pagecontent/qr_code_generation.md:56
msgid ""
"Two things are worth knowing before picking a number. Subclaims 0 and above "
"are reserved by WHO and are allocated together with a trust domain, through "
"the GDHCN Secretariat. Subclaims that are negative integers are the "
"development range and are free to use, so an implementation using one is a "
"pilot or a development deployment and the number is not guaranteed to be "
"stable."
msgstr ""
"在选择编号之前，有两点值得了解。子声明0及以上由世卫组织保留，通过GDHCN秘书处与信任域一并分配。负整数子声明为开发区间，可自由使用，因此使用此类子声明的实现属于试点或开发部署，且其编号不保证稳定。"

