msgid ""
"Regi-TRUST is built on the open-source Trust mAnagement INfrastructure "
"(TRAIN), developed by the Fraunhofer IAO as a part of the European Self-"
"Sovereign Identity Framework (ESSIF) Lab. TRAIN uses/supports several "
"established standards and is flexible with existing architectures, providing"
" technical accessibility and inclusivity for implementors."
msgstr ""
"Regi-TRUST构建于开源的信任管理基础设施（TRAIN）之上，TRAIN由弗劳恩霍夫劳动经济与组织研究所（Fraunhofer "
"IAO）作为欧洲自主权身份框架（ESSIF）实验室的一部分开发。TRAIN使用/支持若干成熟的标准，并能灵活适应现有架构，为实施者提供技术上的可及性和包容性。"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/reference_implementation.md#L38
