#: input/pagecontent/references.md:31
msgid ""
"Elements are defined by JSON-LD. As of 2023-02-12, the most current JSON-LD "
"context for vaccines and for test results is here . Note that the URIs for "
"the DIVOC-specific JSON-LD contexts embedded in the certificates do not "
"resolve.  DIVOC's documentation is here  but this does not include element-"
"level descriptions (e.g., terminology bindings at a per-element level).  "
"Terminology bindings at the element level must be inferred from more general"
" documentation.  The  JSON-LD context introduces the  element for vaccines, "
"but there is no documentation on which codes this element is bound to or "
"whether this is used in production. There is no other computable "
"representation of vaccine type/product."
msgstr ""
"各元素由JSON-LD定义。截至2023-02-12，疫苗和检测结果的最新JSON-LD上下文见此处 。请注意，证书中嵌入的DIVOC专用JSON-"
"LD上下文的URI无法解析。 DIVOC的文档见此处 ，但其中不包括元素级说明（例如逐个元素的术语绑定）。 元素级的术语绑定必须从更一般性的文档中推断。"
"  JSON-LD上下文为疫苗引入了  元素，但没有文档说明该元素绑定到哪些代码，也没有说明是否在生产中使用。疫苗类型/产品没有其他可计算表示形式。"

