"to ensure the trust in issuers of those credentials. Most credentials carry "
"an issuer ID such as an HTTP URL or a DID with the public key material to "
"verify these credentials. To provide a trusted list of these issuers, the "
"gateway provides functionality to upload issuer IDs."
msgstr ""
"对于某些凭证类型（如可验证凭证），需要TNG来确保对这些凭证签发方的信任。大多数凭证都带有签发方ID（如HTTP "
"URL或DID），以及用于验证这些凭证的公钥资料。为了提供这些签发方的可信列表，网关提供了上传签发方ID的功能。"

