#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:275
msgid ""
"Note: This new route is introduced to create a migration path to the trusted"
" references. Within EU DCC Standard Mode, there is no backwards "
"compatibility impact."
msgstr "注：引入这一新路由是为了建立向可信引用迁移的路径。在欧盟DCC标准模式下，不存在向后兼容性影响。"

